                        "email": "andhsieh@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "Ender-Hsieh"
                    },
                    "message": "Please extract `dbusToRfPowerState(std::string_view) -> std::optional<resource::PowerState>` helper and call it from the\ncallback. \nPer bmcweb convention D-Bus enum strings should have an explicit conversion function rather than inline if-else. Also helps shrink the lambda body"
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish-core/lib/fabric.hpp",
                    "line": 93,
                    "reviewer": {
